{\large\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} 關於本書}\qquad{\large\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} About This Book}

\vspace{0.5cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{TextGray}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
本書分六卷十三章研讀歌羅西書全書，整合 CCIC 週四查經班教導、John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，並貫通四福音、保羅其他監獄書信與啟示錄。全書以歌羅西書 2:9-10 為總綱：「因為神本性一切的豐盛，都有形有體地居住在基督裏面；你們在他裏面也得了豐盛。」

A chapter-by-chapter study of all four chapters of Colossians, integrating Elder Wong's Bible teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis, connected throughout to the Gospels, Paul's other prison epistles, and Revelation. The whole book is framed by Colossians 2:9-10: "For in him the whole fullness of deity dwells bodily, and you have been filled in him."
$endif$
